  "kind": "quirk",
  "title": "TRIM strips and collapses only ASCII space (U+0020) and leaves non-breaking spaces and surrogate pairs intact",
  "statement": "In Excel 16.0.20527.20088, TRIM removes leading and trailing ASCII spaces (U+0020) and collapses internal runs of U+0020 to a single space, while preserving other Unicode characters including astral emoji (\" a\"&LEFT(UNICHAR(128512),1)&\" \" becomes \"a😀\").",
  "status": "measured",
  "basis": "Measured in Excel 16.0.20527.20088 in f2_rows (row 19), dcfl2_text (row 48), and jnt_text_formats (rows 108-109), and matched across 2,092/2,092 full-bank TRIM rows.",
